sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant P as primary (shard 0)
  participant S as shards 1..k+m−1
  C->>P: MOSDOp write(off, len)
  P->>P: ECTransaction: split into stripes, decide RMW
  P->>S: (if needed) read the old chunks
  S-->>P: old data
  P->>P: encode / parity delta
  P->>S: ECSubWrite (each shard's chunk + log entry with ObjectModDesc)
  S->>S: BlueStore: write chunk + pg log
  S-->>P: ECSubWriteReply (committed)
  P-->>C: ack after all acting shards commit
  Note over P,S: if a failure happens before all commit:<br/>the log entry is undone by rollback (APPEND/ROLLBACK_EXTENTS/...)
